<title>UK: Citibank warrants on Generale des Eaux.</title>
<headline>Citibank warrants on Generale des Eaux.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 10 million call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Generale des Eaux, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE   ISS PRICE   PREMIUM    GEARING   MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    600.0    10.70 FRF   16.47 PCT  5.7 X     20.NOV.98</p>
<p> CALL B    700.0    11.90 FRF   34.93 PCT  5.1 X     20.NOV.00</p>
<p> PAYDATE	12.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  607.0 --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
